      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "KREA 2 EDIT HQ\n\nUpload the source. Enable only the references you need and describe their roles.\n\n0 references: source-only edit.\n1 reference: direct second-image conditioning.\n2-4 references: labeled sheet in the second input. This is NOT native five-image conditioning.\n\nQwen enhancement is ON and sees source + each individual reference. Its BF16 model unloads before Krea generation. The final prompt appears after execution.\n\nCheckpoint: only compatible Krea 2 weights. Auto sets Raw 20 steps / CFG 3 or Turbo 8 / CFG 1. Custom checkpoints require an explicit sampling preset.\n\nKeep the edit adapter enabled. Two extra LoRAs are optional. Put exact trigger words in the enhancer trigger_words field.\n\nOutput follows source aspect ratio, rounded to multiples of 16, capped at 1.9 MP by default; no automatic upscaling. This is full-frame editing, not a masked pixel-preserving compositor.\n\nRequires the krea workspace build. Source/static-tested, not GPU-certified."
      ]
    }
